cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Guard Dogs: An Active Patrol Layer for Web Runtimes in the AI-Attacker Era"
type: software
version: 0.0.1
abstract: >-
  An agent-based active security layer for web runtimes (Node, PHP). Guard dog
  sidecars patrol each backend layer for exposure, drift and probe-detectable
  weaknesses, escalate through tiered detection, and respond with graduated,
  panel-approved actions that keep humans in the loop. Early research prototype.
authors:
  - alias: sachin-sn
repository-code: "https://github.com/sachin-sn/gaurd-dogs"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - security
  - agents
  - web runtimes
  - intrusion detection
  - llm
